# Everything the build does not need. Keeps the context small (a full node_modules copy is
# slow to send to the daemon) and keeps secrets out of the image entirely.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# Secrets. .env would otherwise be COPYed into the image and readable by anyone who can pull
# it; production config arrives as real environment variables instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
**/*.log
docker-compose*.yml
